{%- doc -%}
  Prints, in cents, the cart amount that counts toward free delivery and the free facial.
  The progress bar and the delivery row both read it, so they always agree. Theme setting
  "Count toward free delivery" picks whether discount codes come off first; set it to match
  what Shopify's "FREE SHIPPING with $100 purchase" rate does at checkout (task P2-22g, note 4).

  @example
  {%- capture dh_basis -%}{% render 'dh-cart-basis' %}{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- assign dh_basis = dh_basis | plus: 0 -%}
{%- enddoc -%}
{%- liquid
  if settings.dh_threshold_basis == 'before_discounts'
    echo cart.original_total_price
  else
    echo cart.total_price
  endif
-%}
